    "what_en": "Claude becomes a web-novel writing coach: topic, worldbuilding, characters, outlines, chapters. Produces setting/volume/per-chapter outlines, tracks characters, foreshadowing, plotlines. Unless asked, it diagnoses only, never writes.",
    "when_en": "Triggered by /story-long-write or 「帮我开书」(start a book), 「写大纲」(outline), 「日更」(daily update). It checks project state, then routes to: new book, continuation, outline expansion, or revision.",
